ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-automatica-desc = The router adjusts the power by itself.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-maxima = Maximum
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-maxima-desc = Full power: the longest possible range.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-media = Medium
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-media-desc = Half power: handy in a small home so the WiFi doesn't reach as far.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-baja = Low
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-baja-desc = 20 % of the power: much less range, for when the router sits next to the devices.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-potencia-recomendado = The router sets the power better than a fixed value.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo = Compatibility
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-desc = Which WiFi generations this radio accepts.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-anac = All devices
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-anac-desc = Accepts WiFi 5 (802.11ac) and the earlier ones on this band: the fastest option.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-an = Without WiFi 5
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-an-desc = Only 802.11a and 802.11n: modern devices go slower. Only for an old device that gives trouble.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-modo-recomendado = With WiFi 5, modern devices go faster and old ones can still connect.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-beamforming = Directed signal (beamforming)
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-beamforming-desc = The router focuses the signal towards each device instead of spreading it evenly, which improves speed at a distance.
ajuste-wifi-radio_5_avanzado-beamforming-recomendado = It improves coverage for devices that support it and does not bother the rest.
